{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13311130","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13311130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1331113001:1":{"text":"눈사람 기계! 이번에는 자동으로 눈사람을 만들어 주는 기계를 만들고 싶어요!","source_cn":"雪人机！我这次想要那种可以自动堆雪人的机器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDE96C86587BC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331113002:1":{"text":"눈사람 만들기가 어렵다고 생각하는 건가?","source_cn":"你是觉得堆雪人很难吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C9E3F3F8120D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1331113003:1":{"text":"평범한 눈사람 만드는 건 당연히 쉽죠. 하지만 디테일한 외형을 가진 눈사람이라면요? 어때요? 기발한 생각 아닌가요?","source_cn":"堆那种普通的雪人当然很容易，那如果是堆那种有外貌细节的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8028C714C37A4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1331113004:1":{"text":"...지금 내가 하는 생각은, 널 어떻게 여기서 내쫓을까 하는 거야!","source_cn":"……我现在唯一的想法，就是怎么把你丢出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x126189B1ABD2A163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人特莱姆":{"text":"상인 틀렘","source":"商人特莱姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人工匠麦驰":{"text":"드워프 장인 마이키","source":"矮人工匠麦驰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人工匠司都恩":{"text":"드워프 장인 시둔","source":"矮人工匠司都恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_ro